    "racesIntroduction": "2026年度Hackathon软件难题挑战赛",
    "title": "【2026Hackathon决赛】5：网络流量在异分布场景下的迁移学习算法",
    "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">网络流量在异分布场景下的迁移学习算法</span></a></span><span><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></span></h1>\n<p style=\"font-family: sans-serif !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 16px !important; ; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\"></span></span><br></p>\n<h2><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">一、题目名称：<span></span></span></a></h2>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">网络流量在异分布场景下的迁移学习算法</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><br></p>\n<h2><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">二、背景信息（赛题产生的业务背景）：<span></span></span></a></h2>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">随着<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">5G</span>网络的快速建设与普及，移动网络流量呈现爆发式增长。运营商正在探索从流量经验向体验经营的转型之路，旨在为终端用户提供更加个性化的网络体验。体验经营的关键能力之一就是对网络流量进行精准分类，例如感知到终端用户在做直播业务或视频业务时，提供更好的网络保障能力。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">然而，现实网络中面临着显著的异分布挑战：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">地域差异：不同省份<span>/</span>地域的<span> 4G/5G NSA/5G SA </span>组网比例、传输层<span> MTU/MSS </span>协商参数、基站调度周期（<span>TTI</span>）及<span> CDN </span>边缘下沉策略各异，导致相同业务的流量时空特征发生偏移<span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">终端与协议配置漂移：不同地域主流终端机型、操作系统版本及应用客户端版本存在差异，导致握手阶段加密套件（<span>Cipher Suites</span>）、<span>TLS </span>扩展字段（<span>SNI</span>、<span>ALPN </span>格式）以及协议交互序列呈现异分布<span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">用户偏好与业务形态演进：同一业务在不同地区、不同时段的表现形态可能不同（如直播业务在发达地区可能高清码率更多）<span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">现网流量在不同地域受网络制式、网络配置、人群偏好等影响，分布偏差较大，如何在有限的样本学习实现通用的识别能力，应对现网复杂多变流量识别是一大挑战。该课题主要面向异分布场景下的网络流量识别，构建迁移学习算法，解决异分布效果下降的难题。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">突破异分布场景下网络流量识别的技术难题，期待你的挑战<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">~</span>！<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<h2><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">三、问题描述（现状、技术挑战等）：<span></span></span></a></h2>\n<h3><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">业务背景：<span></span></span></span></h3>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">1</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、当前核心网产品在做体验经营时，需要对跨地域、跨场景的网络流量进行统一分类。传统的流量分类方法依赖于流量的<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">payload</span>信息（如<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">HTTP</span>协议使用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Host</span>和<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">URI</span>，<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">TLS</span>协议使用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">SNI</span>等），但随着全加密流量的普及以及<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">CDN</span>的广泛使用，传统方法的效果大打折扣。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">更关键的问题是异分布场景下的泛化能力不足：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>(1)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">空间<span>/</span>地域异分布（<span>Spatial Shift</span>）：在<span>A</span>省份<span>/</span>算力节点训练的模型，在<span>B</span>省份部署时，由于当地的基础网络制式差异（<span>4G/5G</span>）、终端设备（<span>Android/iOS/</span>鸿蒙）分布不同、以及当地运营商路由策略的不同，会导致流量的底层物理特征发生偏移，使得分类准确率发生显著下降。<span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>(2)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">时间异分布与演化（<span>Temporal Shift &amp; Concept Drift</span>）：同一地区不同时段的流量模式存在差异（如潮汐效应）。更为严峻的是<span>APP</span>版本的频繁迭代（长程演化），例如版本更新可能引入全新的拥塞控制策略、改变视频自适应码率（<span>ABR</span>）算法、调整心跳包间隔或加密压缩套件，导致原本的流量特征空间发生质变。<span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>(3)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">协议栈异分布（<span>Protocol Shift</span>）：跨网络环境下，可能使用不同的网络协议组合或不同的<span>NAT/</span>代理穿透方式，引发包长序列和时序特征的异变。<span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">2</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、异分布场景下的流量识别面临以下挑战：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>(1)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">数据分布偏移：源域与目标域的特征分布存在显著差异，直接迁移效果差<span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>(2)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">有限标注数据：跨域标注数据获取成本高，只能依赖少量目标域样本进行自适应<span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>(3)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">长程演化：<span>APP</span>版本升级可能引入全新的流量模式，需要模型具备持续学习或快速适应能力<span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>(4)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">计算资源受限：核心网设备对推理时延和效率有较高要求<span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3><span><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">问题抽象：<span></span></span></a></span></h3>\n<ol>\n<li><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>1、<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">任务目标：网络流量识别<b>多分类</b>任务，待分类的网络流量涉及<span>50</span>类应用及<span>1</span>类负类（<span>other</span>），应用示例包括：抖音、爱奇艺等<span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">输入数据格式<span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">赛题提供的原始物理文件为<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> .pcap </span>格式（网络抓包文件）。参赛选手<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/</span>算法需要对这些<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> PCAP </span>文件进行流（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Flow/Session</span>）重建与解析，将其转化为模型可读的特征格式，如<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">payload</span>载荷和流统计特征等。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">训练样本、测试样本、以及保留的测试样本之间是<b>异分布</b>的：<span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">训练集：来自源域<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/</span>源时期的标注样本，允许选手根据策略自行采样或完整使用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">测试集：来自目标域<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/</span>目标时期的样本（与训练集分布不同）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">保留测试集：用于最终评测的目标域样本<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>4、<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">外部资源利用规范<span></span></span></a></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">预训练模型：<b>仅</b>允许使用<b>公开开源</b>的模型，需在交付文档中申明来源及版本。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">自备数据：允许引入自有数据，但需同步提交该部分数据，以供复现合规性审查。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">交付物与评价标准：<span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">评价指标：核心验收指标为保留测试集的精准率（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Precision</span>）与召回率（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Recall</span>）。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">理论交付： 需输出迁移学习算法数学模型，重点阐述域自适应、特征对齐等计算方法。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">工程交付： 提供完整的训练脚本、推理代码及依赖环境说明，确保可稳定复现。复现环境：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Linux</span>，硬件：</span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Intel(R) Xeon(R) Platinum 8378C CPU @ 2.80GHz</span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<h3><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">接口定义：<span></span></span></span></span></h3>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">实现接口的接口名称，接口输入参数，各个输入参数的的数据结构和定义描述等规范信息。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、模型<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/</span>算法训练输入：随题目提供给参赛选手。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">(1) train_metadata.csv</span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">本文件。训练集，<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">sample_id</span>对应一条流样本<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">pcap (</span>一个样本仅使用该流中的前<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">n</span>个数据包，<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">n&lt;32)</span>，给出一个流量标签（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">label</span>）。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">(2) eval_metadata.csv</span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">：选手可见测试集，内容结构同于训练集。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、验收输入<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/</span>输出：等模型<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/</span>算法提交后，再提供验证集用于效果验收。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">(1) </span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">输入：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">test_blind_metadata.csv</span>：该数据集的数据分布与前述“训练样本”及“选手可见测试样本”均呈异分布，完全来自未知的全新域。测试样本仅保留独立的随机<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">ID</span>（如 <span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">test_a1b2.pcap</span>），不提供真实类别与域标签，强制要求模型具备开箱即用的跨域泛化能力，格式同训练样本数据格式。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">(2) </span></span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">输出：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">test_infer_result.csv</span>：给出盲测测试集中每个<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">sample_id</span>对应的<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">predicted_label</span>，包含两列：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">sample_id</span>（盲测样本文件名）和 <span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">predicted_label</span>（预测的应用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/</span>行为类别），格式同训练样本数据格式。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h2><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">四、期望达到的指标和效果（含性能<span>/</span>精度等指标）：<span></span></span></a></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">1</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、精准率：要求流量分类准确率需要达到目标（精准率和召回率均<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&gt;95%</span>）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">2</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、性能：每条样本平均推理时间不超过<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">1ms</span>，最大推理时间不超过<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">5ms</span>。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">3</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、迁移效果：模型在异分布测试集上的性能下降应尽可能小（相对于源域测试集），体现良好的域适应能力<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<h2><span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">五、测试用例</span></span><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">提供给选手的测试集（详见“问题抽象”第<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">3</span>点说明）全部取自公开开源数据集，不涉及任何内部数据。主办方将在提供给选手的测试集上对选手构建的模型进行评测，同时在保留测试集上对选手构建的模型进行评测。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<h2><span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">六、参考文献（可选，如有请提供）：<span></span></span></span></h2>\n<h2><a style=\"color: unset; text-decoration: unset; border-bottom: unset;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">七、评选标准（如评分维度，分成几档等）：<span></span></span></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>1、<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">功能正确。若验证集的精准率低于<span>80%</span>，<span>0</span>分。<span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span>2、<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">对于验证集，准确率越高，计算时间越短，则得分越高。验证集总执行时间不超过<span>10</span>分钟，执行超时<span>0</span>分。</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">额外加分项：<span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">域适应技术运用合理，效果提升明显<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">有限目标域样本下的快速自适应能力<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">长程时间泛化能力（对<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">APP</span>版本升级的适应）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">模型轻量化程度高<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>",
